            "sid": "EZK 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " came to me: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Son of man, set your face against Mount Seir, and prophesy against it, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and say to it, Thus says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": Behold, I am against you, Mount Seir, and I will stretch out my hand against you, and I will make you a desolation and a waste. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will lay your cities waste, and you shall become a desolation; and you shall know that I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because you cherished perpetual enmity, and gave over the people of Israel to the power of the sword at the time of their calamity, at the time of their final punishment; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "therefore, as I live, says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", I will prepare you for blood, and blood shall pursue you; because you are guilty of blood,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "you have hated blood",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " therefore blood shall pursue you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will make Mount Seir a waste and a desolation; and I will cut off from it all who come and go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will fill your mountains with the slain; on your hills and in your valleys and in all your ravines those slain with the sword shall fall. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will make you a perpetual desolation, and your cities shall not be inhabited. Then you will know that I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Because you said, ‘These two nations and these two countries shall be mine, and we will take possession of them,’—although the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " was there— ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "therefore, as I live, says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", I will deal with you according to the anger and envy which you showed because of your hatred against them; and I will make myself known among you,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35.11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " when I judge you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall know that I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have heard all the revilings which you uttered against the mountains of Israel, saying, ‘They are laid desolate, they are given us to devour.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you magnified yourselves against me with your mouth, and multiplied your words against me; I heard it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": For the rejoicing of the whole earth I will make you desolate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As you rejoiced over the inheritance of the house of Israel, because it was desolate, so I will deal with you; you shall be desolate, Mount Seir, and all Edom, all of it. Then they will know that I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
